  "Bug_Title": "RestrictedApi",
  "Bug_Details": "Check for non-allowlisted callers to RestrictedApiChecker. Calls to APIs marked @RestrictedApi are prohibited without a corresponding\nallowlist annotation. The intended use-case for @RestrictedApi is to restrict calls to annotated\nmethods so that each usage of those APIs must be reviewed separately. For\nexample, an API might lead to security bugs unless the programmer uses it\ncorrectly. See the\njavadoc for @RestrictedApi\nfor more details.",
